## Defect report

```
<DEFECT-ID>  case <CASE-ID>  severity <level>  @ <revision>  env <environment>  role <role>
Step:        <the step that failed>
Expected:    <from the plan>
Actual:      <observed>
Evidence:    <files>
Reproduce:   <minimal steps / request>
Suspected:   <area, if obvious — not a code fix>
```

Send to {{defect_channel}} for the Code Writer.

## Flaky results

Rerun a failing case once. Different outcomes → report it as flaky with both results; never `PASS`.

## Re-test after a fix

On the new, re-reviewed revision: rerun the failed cases and the regression cases touching the same area; update the environment record.

